     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-31 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>BRS Leader Harish Rao Accuses Revanth Reddy of 'Credit Chori' in Land Cases</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Bharat Rashtra Samithi senior leader T. Harish Rao accused Chief Minister A. Revanth Reddy of 'credit chori' regarding the Supreme Court victory in the Miyapur lands case. Rao asserted that the previous BRS government protected government lands and fought the majority of hearings in the case prior to 2023. He further alleged that the current administration mishandled the Manchirevulu land case involving Greyhounds, resulting in a multi-crore scam and unauthorized land registrations.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-31/brs-leader-harish-rao-accuses-revanth-reddy-of-credit-chori-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>According to Rao, the Revanth Reddy government facilitated illegal property registrations and failed to challenge adverse legal cancellations regarding land acquired for the Greyhounds Firing Range. He claimed that valuable government parcels were registered without proper fees while remaining recorded under Greyhounds in official records. The BRS leader contrasted these actions with his party's historical efforts to defend state property and prosecute offenders.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately represents Harish Rao's press conference claims regarding Miyapur and Manchirevulu land disputes.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/telangana/revanth-reddy-resorting-to-credit-chori-in-land-cases-fought-by-brs-govt-harish-rao/article71649990.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-31/brs-leader-harish-rao-accuses-revanth-reddy-of-credit-chori-" data-title="BRS Leader Harish Rao Accuses Revanth Reddy of 'Credit Chori' in Land Cases"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
         <a class="sh-tg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.4 1.6 1.6 7l3.6 1.2L6 13l2.2-3.1 3.4 2.4 2.8-10.7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Telegram</a> ·
