       <h1>IIM Ahmedabad Summer Placements Attract Major Recruiters in Cluster 3</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#Placements</span> <span>#IIM Ahmedabad</span></div>
       <p>IIM Ahmedabad's summer placement drive has seen prominent companies participate as recruiters within Cluster 3, according to India Today. This phase of placements attracted a diverse range of industry leaders.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-31/iim-ahmedabad-summer-placements-attract-major-recruiters-in-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Key recruiters identified in Cluster 3 include technology giant Microsoft, IT services major TCS, and financial institution Axis Bank. Their participation highlights the strong industry interest in IIM Ahmedabad's talent pool.</p><p>The inclusion of such significant firms in Cluster 3 underscores the competitive nature of the summer placements at IIM Ahmedabad.</p><p>What to watch: Further details on other participating companies and placement statistics.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately covers the provided summary, identifying the cluster and the specific recruiters mentioned. It is concise and professional.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" rel="noopener">Education (aggregate)</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
