     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-31 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge conf" title="Reported by Bollywood Hungama, TOI Entertainment">confirmed by 2 sources</span></div>
       <h1>Pa. Ranjith's Vettuvam Sets Worldwide Pongal 2027 Release</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Director Pa. Ranjith’s pan-Indian action-drama Vettuvam, starring Arya, Sobhita Dhulipala, and Kalaiyarasan, is confirmed for a worldwide theatrical release during Pongal 2027. The makers unveiled a new poster to coincide with the announcement, showcasing the film’s expansive scale and territorial narrative.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-31/pa-ranjiths-vettuvam-sets-worldwide-pongal-2027-release.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Set against a backdrop of land-dominance turf wars, the film features sequences involving traditional martial arts and Mallakhamba. Produced by Neelam Productions and Learn and Teach Production with music by G.V. Prakash Kumar, the project will be released in Tamil, Telugu, Hindi, Malayalam, and Kannada. The narrative explores themes of historical conflict shaping the present, marking Ranjith’s latest directorial effort.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article is well-sourced and covers the key details effectively. One minor detail regarding the ensemble cast was drawn from the full text rather than the summary, which is acceptable practice.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source · also covered by 1 more</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/south-cinema/vettuvam-pa-ranjith-directorial-starring-arya-locks-pongal-2027-worldwide-release-new-poster-unveiled/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/tamil/movies/news/pa-ranjiths-vettuvam-release-date-locked-arya-dinesh-sobhita-dhulipala-starrer-joins-rajinikanths-dharman-and-sivakarthikeyan-seyon-in-pongal-2027-race/articleshow/135389356.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>This brief was written from the original report. The same event was independently covered by the other outlets listed here.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-31/pa-ranjiths-vettuvam-sets-worldwide-pongal-2027-release" data-title="Pa. Ranjith's Vettuvam Sets Worldwide Pongal 2027 Release"><b>Share:</b>
