       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-31 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Theft Convict Raghavan Escapes Police Custody in Coimbatore</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>A 25-year-old theft convict, Raghavan, escaped from police custody in Coimbatore early Saturday, marking his second escape this year. He had been remanded to judicial custody by a local magistrate just hours earlier but managed to flee by pushing guards before entering Coimbatore Central Prison.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-31/theft-convict-raghavan-escapes-police-custody-in-coimbatore.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Authorities have launched an intensive search using drone surveillance and CCTV analysis. Four police personnel responsible for escorting the prisoner have been suspended for duty lapses, and the Race Course police have registered a new case regarding the escape.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief covers the essential facts including the timing, location, circumstances of escape, and police response.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/convict-escapes-from-police-custody-before-being-lodged-in-coimbatore-central-prison/article71648346.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/coimbatore/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Coimbatore</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
